<title>USA: VASCO, Shiva in licensing pact.</title>
<headline>VASCO, Shiva in licensing pact.</headline>
<dateline>LOMBARD, Ill. 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>VASCO Corp said Tuesday it entered into a co-development partnership with Shiva Corp.</p>
<p>The agreement calls for VASCO to license the Shiva AccessManager and for Shiva to integrate support for VASCO's hard token devices into its Shiva AccessManager.</p>
<p>AccessManager provides a centralized, flexible way to manage network access. VASCO's AccessKey is a one-time password token device that provides authentication and authorization security over static passwords.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
